      <h2>The MooLatté® Deep Dive: Coffee Extraction Meets Dairy Soft Serve</h2>
      <p>Dairy Queen's signature <a href="/items/moolatte">MooLatté</a> is an engineered response to coffeehouse frappes. Rather than using artificial instant powders, DQ combines genuine dark-roasted cold coffee extract with 5% milkfat vanilla soft serve and crushed ice, crowned with whipped cream and syrup drizzles.</p>

      <h3>MooLatté Flavor Profile Analysis:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Mocha MooLatté:</strong> Dark cocoa fudge blended with coffee extract. The rich cocoa lipids soften coffee acidity, delivering a velvet dark-truffle finish.</li>
        <li><strong>Caramel MooLatté:</strong> Golden butterscotch caramel ribbons swirled into the coffee base. Sweet, buttery, and popular for morning commuters.</li>
        <li><strong>Vanilla MooLatté:</strong> Pure roasted coffee notes highlighted by clean dairy creaminess.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Laboratory Caffeine Audit:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Small (16 oz):</strong> ~45 mg caffeine (equivalent to a 12 oz soda)</li>
        <li><strong>Medium (24 oz):</strong> ~65 mg caffeine (equivalent to a standard single espresso shot)</li>
        <li><strong>Large (32 oz):</strong> ~85 mg caffeine (equivalent to a full mug of drip Arabica coffee)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>The Misty® Slush: High-Yield Hydration &amp; Creamsicle Hacks</h2>
      <p>For hot summer afternoons when heavy dairy feels overwhelming, the <a href="/items/misty-slush">Misty Slush</a> is DQ's dairy-free hero. Micro-crushed ice is charged with fruit syrups in Blue Raspberry, Cherry, Strawberry Kiwi, and Lemon Lime. For an unadvertised retro delight, order a <em>Misty Freeze</em>: the kitchen blends a swirl of vanilla soft serve directly into the fruit slush, transforming it into an effervescent, creamy creamsicle.</p>

